 		<p>You understand unarmed contests, holds, training, crowds, injuries, and fighting houses. Your unarmed attacks inflict 2d6 damage instead of 1d6.</p>
 		<p>You may identify fighting styles and enter fighting venues. At the Referee's discretion, you may know trainers, gamblers, promoters, or rivals.</p>
